<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-top: none;
        }
        .manifest-info {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
        .value {
            color: #111827;
        }
        .action-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .alert {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>You Have Been Assigned to a Manifest</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{ recipient.fullName }},</p>
        
        <p>You have been assigned to the following manifest:</p>
        
        <div class="manifest-info">
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">Manifest Number:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ manifest.manifestNumber }}</span>
            </div>
            {% if manifest.vesselName %}
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">Vessel Name:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ manifest.vesselName }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if manifest.voyageNumber %}
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">Voyage Number:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ manifest.voyageNumber }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if consignee.businessName %}
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">Consignee:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ consignee.businessName }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if broker.fullName %}
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="label">Broker:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ broker.fullName }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        
        <div class="alert">
            <strong>Next Step:</strong> To access the manifest details, you need to submit a payment of <strong>{{ 500|format_money('PHP') }}</strong> for manifest access.
        </div>
        
        <p style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ url('app_login') }}" class="action-button">Login to Submit Payment</a>
        </p>
        
        <p>Once your payment is verified, you will be able to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>View complete manifest details</li>
            <li>Download Notice of Arrival (NOA)</li>
            <li>Access billing information</li>
            <li>Upload Bill of Lading (if applicable)</li>
            <li>Download Electronic Delivery Order (eDO) after final payment</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>If you have any questions, please contact the shipping line staff.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>Optimus Shipping Portal</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated notification from Optimus Shipping Portal.</p>
        <p>Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
